/* 

  Growth in yeast culture in Picat.

  From A First Course in Mathematical Modeling, 4th edition,
  page 10ff

  Δp(n) = p(n+1) - p(n) = k * (capacity - p(n)) * p(n)
  p(n+1) = p(n) + k * (capacity - p(n))*p(n) 
  capacity ~ 665
  k        ~ 0.00082


  Cf my Gamble model gamble_growth_in_yeast_culture.rkt

  This program was created by Hakan Kjellerstrand, hakank@gmail.com
  See also my Picat page: http://www.hakank.org/picat/

*/

import ppl_distributions, ppl_utils.
import util.
% import ordset.

main => go.

